{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f3c1a52-6d44-4f0b-9d2e-7c0b5a1e2f10",
    "name": "Booking SaaS — Bookings API (Week 2)",
    "description": "Idempotent booking endpoints for the multi-tenant SaaS starter.\n\n## Setup\n1. Set the `baseUrl` variable to your tenant subdomain, e.g. `http://acme.lvh.me:5000`.\n2. Run **Auth → Login**. Postman stores the httpOnly cookies automatically and the test script also copies the access token into `{{token}}` for Bearer-style clients.\n3. Run the requests in **Bookings**.\n\n## Automatic variables\nA collection-level pre-request script runs before EVERY request and sets:\n- `{{idempotencyKey}}` — a fresh UUID v4\n- `{{startAt}}` / `{{endAt}}` — a grid-aligned 1-hour window ~24h in the future\n\nThat matters because the API rejects bookings in the past and requires start/end times aligned to a 5-minute boundary.\n\nSee `docs/API.md` for the full contract.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// A fresh Idempotency-Key for every send. Real clients generate ONE",
          "// key per booking intent and reuse it across retries.",
          "const uuid = 'xxxxxxxx-xxxx-4xxx-yxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx'.replace(/[xy]/g, (c) => {",
          "  const r = (Math.random() * 16) | 0;",
          "  const v = c === 'x' ? r : ((r & 0x3) | 0x8);",
          "  return v.toString(16);",
          "});",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('idempotencyKey', uuid);",
          "",
          "// The API rejects past bookings and requires 5-minute grid alignment,",
          "// so build a valid window ~24h ahead.",
          "const start = new Date(Date.now() + 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);",
          "start.setUTCSeconds(0, 0);",
          "start.setUTCMinutes(Math.ceil(start.getUTCMinutes() / 5) * 5);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('startAt', start.toISOString());",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('endAt', new Date(start.getTime() + 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString());"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://acme.lvh.me:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bookingId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bookingVersion", "value": "0", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "idempotencyKey", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "replayKey", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "startAt", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "endAt", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "resourceId", "value": "room-1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('logged in', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "// Copy the access token out of the cookie jar so scripts can use",
                  "// Authorization: Bearer instead of cookies if they prefer.",
                  "const jar = pm.cookies;",
                  "if (jar.has('access_token')) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jar.get('access_token'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alice@acme.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Seeded credentials from `npm run seed`. Sets httpOnly access/refresh cookies."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
